GROOPS v3 orbital-comparison extension

These extension files integrate with GROOPS, copyright its respective authors,
and are provided under GPL-3.0-or-later. See LICENSE in this directory.
The upstream source is fetched separately and pinned by scripts/build_groops.py;
it is not vendored into this repository. Upstream copyright notices must be
retained in any modified-source or binary distribution.

GROOPS reference:
Mayer-Guerr et al. (2021), GROOPS: A software toolkit for gravity field recovery
and GNSS processing. Computers & Geosciences, 104864.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cageo.2021.104864

The extension adds a nonlinear log-density force multiplier, its knot
sensitivities, and a coupled stationary OU prior. These additions are not part
of the unmodified upstream engine or a reproduction of the Calliess RTN model.
